---
---
<section class="hero hero-bg">

  <p class="setup">You're spending real money on marketing.</p>

  <h1>
    <span class="hero-word">Your</span>
    <span class="hero-word">buyers</span>
    <span class="hero-word">are</span>
    <span class="hero-word">already</span>
    <span class="hero-word">deciding.</span>
    <span class="hero-word">You're</span>
    <span class="hero-word">not</span>
    <span class="hero-word">in</span>
    <span class="hero-word">the</span>
    <span class="hero-word">room.</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="lead hero-sub">
    $18,000 a month. Already earned. Already gone.
  </p>

  <div class="hero-stats hero-sub">
    <div class="stat">
      <span class="stat-num" data-count="2400" data-duration="2.2">2,400</span>
      <span class="stat-label">businesses diagnosed</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-sep"></div>
    <div class="stat">
      <span class="stat-num stat-zero" data-zero-pulse>Zero</span>
      <span class="stat-label">refunds requested</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-foot hero-cta">
    <p class="transition-line">It breaks in one of four ways. Which one is yours?</p>
    <span class="fork">Selling to businesses? <a href="/b2b/" class="fork-link">Start here →</a></span>
  </div>

</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 56px 32px 72px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both;
  }
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  /* ── Setup eyebrow ── */
  .setup {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(244, 241, 236, 0.35);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  /* ── H1 ── */
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 74px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.04;
    color: #f4f1ec;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .hero-word {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  /* ── Lead — the emotional gut punch ── */
  .lead {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: rgba(244, 241, 236, 0.80);
    margin-bottom: 44px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  /* ── Stats row ── */
  .hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
    max-width: 380px;
  }
  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #c9a84c;
  }
  .stat-zero {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #5C7BAA;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .stat-sep {
    width: 1px;
    height: 44px;
    background: #253B66;
    margin: 0 28px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ── Footer — bridge to cards ── */
  .hero-foot {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    padding-top: 36px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(37, 59, 102, 0.5);
  }
  .transition-line {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #C5D3E3;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .fork {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #5C7BAA;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .fork-link {
    color: #c9a84c;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .fork-link:hover { color: #e8c97a; }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero { padding: 40px 20px 52px; }
    .stat-num { font-size: 30px; }
    .lead { font-size: 19px; }
  }
</style>
